not permit firm conclusions, they support the idea that also among female populations the SCL diet exerts a preventive  
effect on CHD."}, {"study_index": 104, "title": "Does stage of change modify the effectiveness of an educational        
intervention to improve diet among family members of hospitalized cardiovascular disease patients?", "abstract":        
"OBJECTIVE The purpose of this study was to evaluate whether effectiveness of a special intervention to improve diet vs 
