  fat or usual diet; 4) not multifactorial; 5) adult humans with/without CVD (not acutely ill,                          
  pregnant/breastfeeding); 6) intervention ≥24 months; 7) mortality or CVD morbidity data available.\n\nINCLUDED        
  STUDIES (5):\n- Study 169: Lyon Diet Heart Study intermediate analysis - randomized secondary prevention trial, 27    
  month follow-up, Mediterranean alpha-linolenic acid-rich diet vs prudent diet, cardiac deaths and non-fatal MI        
