│ mean changes in controls, the exercisers and dieters significantly increased HDL2 mass (48.6% and 47.1%,             │
│ respectively), decreased VLDL mass (-23.9% and -25.5%), and increased LDL peak particle diameter (2.4 and 3.2 A).    │
│ When adjusted to an equivalent change in body mass index by analysis of covariance, 1) exercise-induced and          │
