two dietary methods of treating hyperlipidaemia", "abstract": "OBJECTIVES To compare the long term metabolic effects of 
two diets for treating hyperlipidaemia. DESIGN Randomised controlled study: after three weeks of normal (control) diet, 
subjects were randomly allocated to one of two test diets and followed up for six months. SETTING Lipid clinic of       
