in Moselle farmers", "abstract": "Platelet function and composition, lipemia, and dietary habits were evaluated yearly 
in 98 male farmers from Moselle (East of France) before and after decreasing, in half of them, dietary saturated fats 
from 16.2% to 9.9% of calories (P/S from 0.32 to 0.97). One year after these dietary changes, cholesterol and 
