body weight (INT -1.08 +/- 4.30 kg; CON +0.16 +/- 4.91 kg, P = 0.01), homeostatis model assessment index for insulin    
resistance and 2-h FFA. Two-hour glucose concentrations improved in the INT group, the difference being most pronounced 
