health maintenance organization, were randomized by site into 3 groups: (1) usual care; (2) physician nutrition         
counseling training; and (3) physician nutrition counseling training plus an office-support program. Eleven hundred     
sixty-two of their patients with blood total cholesterol levels in the highest 25th percentile, having previously       
