│ industries viewed with hostility any sugges-tion that the American diet might be better, or at least might be        │
│ different. I recall only too vividly a lecture I gave in Wisconsin on the subject of fat in the diet.\\" Yankee go   │
│ home\\" is a weak insult compared to the robust epithets usedin classifying me. Today we have less contention but    │
│ about as much con-fusion.Am Heart Assoc"}, {"study_index": 505, "title": "The influence of dietary fats on platelets │
